OL,3,GNEWSAHomes will be 'completely dwarfed'
OL,4,Aby warehouses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA residents' group has expressed
OL,7,Fconcern that their homes will be
OL,8,F"completely dwarfed" by a large
OL,9,Fwarehouse development being built on
OL,10,Ftheir doorsteps.
OL,12,FThe largest warehouse planned for the
OL,13,Fsite in Eccles, Salford, is set to be
OL,14,F60ft (18m) high, according to nearby
OL,15,Fresident Andy Spratt.
OL,17,FHe also raised concerns about what
OL,18,Fcould be in the ground at the former
OL,19,Fsite of a chemical plant.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
