OL,3,GNEWSAHomes will be 'completely dwarfed'
OL,4,Aby warehouses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for developer Aviva
OL,7,FInvestors said: "There is no evidence
OL,8,Fof any contamination from the previous
OL,9,Fuse of the site, nor has any evidence
OL,10,Fof the presence of chemicals appeared
OL,11,Fthroughout the conveyancing and survey
OL,12,Fprocess prior to work starting, nor
OL,13,Fsince work has commenced."
